<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - APAC TeleServices started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - APAC TeleServices started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens said analyst Wayne Johnson started coverage of APAC TeleServices Inc with a long-term attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/2 to 57-1/2.</p>
